@startuml Quote Generation Flow
title Quote Generation Sequence

actor SalesRep
participant LWC as "Quote Builder UI"
participant Service as "QuoteGenerationService"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"
participant AI as "Einstein AI"

== Initialize Quote ==
SalesRep -> LWC: Open Quote Builder
LWC -> Service: getQuoteTemplates()
Service -> Database: SELECT FROM TALEXO_Quote__c WHERE IsPrimary__c = true
Database --> Service: Template data
Service --> LWC: Available templates

== Generate Quote ==
SalesRep -> LWC: Select products + opportunity
LWC -> Service: generateQuote(request)
Service -> Database: Check existing primary quotes
Database --> Service: Existing quotes

alt Has existing primary quote
    Service -> Database: UPDATE existing SET IsPrimary__c = false
end

Service -> Database: INSERT TALEXO_Quote__c
Service -> Database: INSERT NexusQuoteLineItem__c[]
Database --> Service: Quote created

== Apply AI Scoring ==
Service -> AI: Score quote acceptance probability
AI --> Service: AI prediction + reasoning
Service -> Database: UPDATE TALEXO_Quote__c SET AcceptanceProbability__c, AIReason__c
Database --> Service: Updated

== Calculate Totals ==
Service -> Database: Calculate GrandTotal__c
Database --> Service: Total amount
Service -> Database: UPDATE GrandTotal__c
Database --> Service: Final quote

Service --> LWC: QuoteResponse
LWC --> SalesRep: Quote generated + PDF download
@enduml